sequenceDiagram
  participant Owner as Owner source
  participant CLI as Ravel CLI
  participant Cache as Snapshots
  participant Parent as Session A
  participant Reader as Detached reader
  participant Next as Session B
  CLI->>Owner: Capture local tree or exact commit
  CLI->>Cache: Publish snapshots and descriptor X
  CLI->>Parent: Add directories to the prompt<br/>RAVEL_SKILL_DIRECTORIES names X
  Parent->>Reader: Forward X and obligations<br/>with read access
  Note over Parent,Reader: Ordinary descendants end with A<br/>this reader is outside its group
  Parent->>Cache: With the recovery instruction kept<br/>recover X through the variable
  Note over Parent,Cache: Whole-preamble loss needs an unprompted trial<br/>a kept path does not keep instructions
  Owner->>Owner: Edit source or configured pin
  Next->>CLI: Independent resolution
  CLI->>Cache: Publish snapshots and descriptor Y
  CLI->>Next: Add the new directory set Y
  Reader->>Cache: Read X and resources after A exits
  Note over Cache,Reader: No automatic pruning<br/>stop affected readers before removal
